# Batch Log Truncation Removal Workflow

1. Identify and locate all occurrences of .slice() or any character limit in BatchWriteService.ts, CronService.ts, and RuleEvaluator.ts.
2. Remove all instances of .slice() and any other character limits on logged fields.
3. Check ollama_metadata.log for truncated logs and ensure full content is written.
4. Rebuild the project following instructions to ensure no changes affect functionality.
